<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 3.8 points to 744.1 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 3.8 points to 744.1 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 3.8 points on Tuesday to 744.1 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Six of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the investment fund index losing the most, down 38.7 points to 1,129.3.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
